  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "全球經濟分析",
    "sub_ename": "GLOBAL ECONOMIC ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "金融自由化與前球化在80年代被廣泛推出以後 90年代的金融改革也跟著被引出 由於2008的全球金融危機 金融改革也進一步被廣泛執行 面對訊息萬變的全球經濟與金融變革進一步改變了傳統商業模型 尤其是金融科技在2010被介紹引出後 從此課程學生將會學習到傳統商業如何面對此經濟與金融變革之挑戰及因應之道。",
    "describe_eh": "After the financial reforms in the 1990s, the financial reforms in the 1990s were also introduced. Due to the 2008 global financial crisis, financial reforms were further widely implemented. Faced with the ever-changing information, the global economic and financial reforms have further changed. After the introduction of traditional business models, especially financial technology, in 2010",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
